WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Lie on your left side with the legs stacked and the head resting on the left arm.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Bend the right knee and hold the right big toe (or a strap).

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Extend the right leg toward the sky, flexing the foot.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Keep the hips stacked and the bottom waist long.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Release and roll to the other side.
